jellyfin-hotcache (1.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add stock Jellyfin core SQLite playback-history support.
  * Load the optional environment file directly for command-line runs.
  * Use explicit IEC units and expanded cache/category reporting.
  * Add ZFS dataset, quota, refquota, and available-space reporting.
  * Add configurable cold-cache demotion with a 14-day default.
  * Correct projected cache accounting after demotion and restore operations.
  * Reconcile already-promoted media with manifest and on-disk cache state.
  * Distinguish current promoted state from promotion actions and candidates.
  * Add Docker-based PostgreSQL and Jellyfin integration qualification.

 -- Alan Johnson <alan@argentwolf.org>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 10:15:00 -0400

jellyfin-hotcache (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First formally packaged release.
  * Add safety-correct path and symlink handling.
  * Add fail-closed Jellyfin session and playback-history checks.
  * Add PostgreSQL UserData play-count handling.
  * Add read-only --check preflight.
  * Add modern Jellyfin API authorization.
  * Add regression and PostgreSQL 18 integration tests.
  * Preserve operator-owned configuration across package upgrades.

 -- Alan <alan@argentwolf.org>  Sat, 26 Sep 2026 18:40:00 -0400
